:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CMDAUTL'.
:IMPORT NAME=ADDAUTLE PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=CHGAUTLE PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=CRTAUTL PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DLTAUTL PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPAUTL PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPAUTLOBJ PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=EDTAUTL PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RMVAUTLE PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKAUTL PNLGRP=QHSYCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP=HLPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDAUTL HELP=HLPCMDAUTL KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.Authorization List Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?ADDAUTLE' HELP=ADDAUTLE.Add Auth List Entry  ADDAUTLE
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?CHGAUTLE' HELP=CHGAUTLE.Change Auth List Entry  CHGAUTLE
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?CRTAUTL' HELP=CRTAUTL.Create Authorization List  CRTAUTL
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?DLTAUTL' HELP=DLTAUTL.Delete Authorization List  DLTAUTL
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?DSPAUTL' HELP=DSPAUTL.Display Authorization List  DSPAUTL
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?DSPAUTLDLO'.
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?DSPAUTLOBJ' HELP=DSPAUTLOBJ.Display Auth List Objects  DSPAUTLOBJ
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?EDTAUTL' HELP=EDTAUTL.Edit Authorization List  EDTAUTL
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD ?RMVAUTLE' HELP=RMVAUTLE.Remove Auth List Entry  RMVAUTLE
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?RTVAUTLE'.
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='CMD ?WRKAUTL' HELP=WRKAUTL.Work with Authorization Lists  WRKAUTL
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDAUTL.Authorization List Commands - Help
:P.Authorization List Commands: every command whose name carries AUTL after its verb, in name order, with the command name at the right of its row. The option numbers follow the full command set of the systems this one is compatible with, so a blank row is a command this release does not provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command groups.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPKEYS.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F1=Help
:PD.Shows help for the item the cursor is on; on the title, help for the whole menu.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Leaves the menu and the menus it was reached from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous menu.
:PT.F16=Major menu
:PD.Shows that menu.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
